This product includes plan-reading logic adapted from the sqlserver-query-plans
plugin by Erik Darling (https://github.com/erikdarlingdata/claude-plugins):
self-time attribution across row mode, batch mode, exchanges and threads
(including self CPU summed across threads, from version 1.5.6),
per-execution estimate checks, fixed-guess estimate fingerprints, the runtime
row-goal result read from ActualEndOfScans (from version 1.5.5), and handling
of untrusted plan text. See src/azure_sql_mcp/plan_tree.py and
src/azure_sql_mcp/plan_digest.py. Tests for those two versions are ported in
tests/unit/test_plan_tree.py and tests/unit/test_plan_digest.py.

Cursor-statement coverage and the leading-wildcard LIKE check close gaps that
were found by comparison with PerformanceMonitor by Erik Darling and Darling
Data, LLC (https://github.com/erikdarlingdata/PerformanceMonitor, MIT
License). No PerformanceMonitor code is included.

